## Import

Mounts can be imported using their ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_mount.example abc123-mount-id
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_mount.example
  id = "abc123-mount-id"
}
```
